# Cold and windy: feels-like arrives over MQTT and is BELOW the air temperature.
# This is the case a locally computed heat index can never produce - heat index is a
# hot-weather concept and returns roughly the air temperature below 80F - so without a
# scenario like this the wind-chill branch and SENSOR_FEELSLIKE_COLD_COLOR have no
# coverage at all until January.
time         2026-01-15 07:30:00
temp         28
humidity     55
feels_like   14
sensor_dead  false
trains       6 14 22 31
bluetrains   3 11 19 28
event        Ski trip
event_days   9
flight       UA451
flight_dest  CO
weather      fixtures/open-meteo-winter.json
